{'symbol': 'BALL', 'date': '2023-03-16 07:00:00', 'title': 'CD&R APPOINTS FORMER BALL CORPORATION CHAIRMAN AND CEO JOHN HAYES AS OPERATING ADVISOR', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MARCH 16, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CLAYTON, DUBILIER & RICE ("CD&R" OR "THE FIRM") TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF JOHN HAYES, FORMER CHAIRMAN AND CEO OF BALL CORPORATION, AS AN OPERATING ADVISOR TO CD&R FUNDS WITH A FOCUS ACROSS THE INDUSTRIALS SECTOR. MR. HAYES BRINGS NEARLY 25 YEARS OF EXPERIENCE AND GLOBAL PERSPECTIVE AS A SENIOR EXECUTIVE AND LEADER IN THE INDUSTRIALS SPACE.'}